et=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Cloth\" title=\"Cloth\">Cloth</a>:</b> <b>Cloth</b> is a very common material used in <a href=\"/page/Handwraps\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Handwraps\">handwraps</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Cloth_armor\" title=\"Category:Cloth armor\">robes, outfits</a>. and other <a href=\"/page/Accessories\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Accessories\">accessories</a>.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">33\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0008003000</span>8,003<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">0.50 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Unquiet_Graves\" title=\"The Unquiet Graves\">The Unquiet Graves</a></b>, End chest&#160;;<br /><a href=\"/page/Menace_of_the_Underdark:_The_Darkening\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Menace of the Underdark: The Darkening\">Menace of the Underdark: The Darkening</a>, Quest chain end reward\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+6 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+6 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Entropic\" title=\"Entropic\">Entropic </a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Entropic\" title=\"Entropic\">Entropic </a>:</b> An entropic weapon crackles with a sinister energy that seeks to unmake anything it contacts. When it strikes a target, they take an extra 2 to 12 points of untyped damage.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Soul_Eating\" title=\"Soul Eating\">Soul Eating</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Soul_Eating\" title=\"Soul Eating\">Soul Eating</a>:</b> On a <a href=\"/page/Vorpal_Strike\" title=\"Vorpal Strike\">Vorpal strike</a>, the dark energy that inhabits this weapon will tear at the soul of your foe, inflicting up to three <a href=\"/page/Negative_level\" title=\"Negative level\">negative levels</a> to your target. The Soul Eating weapon will feed this stolen life back to you in the form of 35 <a href=\"/page/Temporary_hit_point\" title=\"Temporary hit point\">temporary hit points</a> that last for one minute or until depleted by incoming damage.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Improved_Destruction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Improved Destruction\">Improved Destruction</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Improved_Destruction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Improved Destruction\">Improved Destruction</a>:</b> On Hit: Your target gains a stack of Armor Destruction. (-1 penalty to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>, -1% of its <a href=\"/page/Fortification\" title=\"Fortification\">Fortification</a>. 20 Second Duration. Stacks up to 15 times.) This effect may trigger once every second.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Stunning\" title=\"Stunning\"> Stunning +10</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Stunning\" title=\"Stunning\"> Stunning +10</a>:</b> +10 Enhancement bonus to the DC of character's Stunning Blow and Stunning Fist attempts.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Taint_of_Evil\" title=\"Taint of Evil\">Taint of Evil</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Taint_of_Evil\" title=\"Taint of Evil\">Taint of Evil</a>:</b> Good aligned characters equipping this item suffer a temporary <a href=\"/page/Negative_level\" title=\"Negative level\">negative level</a> until the item is removed.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Grave_Wrappings.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Grave_Wrappings.png/420px-Grave_Wrappings.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"662\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Grave_Wrappings.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>These strips of cloth previously adorned a denizen of Eveningstar's Deep Glen Graveyard. After being exposed to Drow necromancy, they are left imbued with a powerful and evil energy.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>This item, like the others from this chain, can be acquired as an end reward for the chain as <a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a>.\n</p><p>If you have a <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Manslayer\" title=\"Manslayer\">Manslayer</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Manslayer\" title=\"Manslayer\">Manslayer</a>:</b> While wearing this item, your weapon attacks gain the devastating ability to defeat a <a href=\"/page/Humanoid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Humanoid\">humanoid</a> opponent with a single decisive blow. On an attack roll of 20 which is confirmed as a critical hit a <a href=\"/page/Humanoid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Humanoid\">humanoid</a> target will be killed. Powerful <a href=\"/page/Humanoid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Humanoid\">humanoids</a> may resist the vorpal strike and instead take 100 points of damage until they have been sufficiently weakened.</span></span> effect applied from another item that effect will override the level drain for most MOBs. However, if the target is immune to the Manslayer effect, then the level drain will trigger.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817211407\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.095 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.167 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5031/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38092/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12883/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n103.39%  148.587     80 Template:IO\n100.00%  143.710      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  143.710      1 -total\n 95.36%  137.047      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 36.55%   52.523      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 35.38%   50.848      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 32.18%   46.243      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 30.95%   44.478      2 Template:InCategory\n 21.26%   30.552     10 Template:Popup\n 13.78%   19.806      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:24202-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817211407 and revision id 672357. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
  "wikitext": "{{Named item|Weapon\n  | name                     = Grave Wrappings\n  | damage                   = 3[1d6] + 6 Bludgeon, Magic\n  | crit                     = 20 / x2\n  | type                     = Handwrap\n  | hand                     = Simple\n  | class                    = Bludgeoning\n  | damagemod                = STR, DEX\n  | attackmod                = STR, DEX\n  | prof                     = Exotic\n  | minlevel                 = 20\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtC|BoE}} or {{Bind|BtC|BoA}}\n  | durability               = 320\n  | material                 = Cloth\n  | hardness                 = 33\n  | basevalue                = 8,003pp\n  | weight                   = 0.50 lbs\n  | revamped                 = Update 76\n  | quest                    = The Unquiet Graves\n  | chest                    = End chest ;<br />[[Menace of the Underdark: The Darkening]], Quest chain end reward\n  | enhancements             = \n* {{Enhancement bonus|w|6}}\n* {{Entropic}}\n* {{Soul Eating}}\n* {{Destruction|Improved}}\n* {{Stunning|10}}\n* {{Taint of Evil}}\n  | description              = These strips of cloth previously adorned a denizen of Eveningstar's Deep Glen Graveyard. After being exposed to Drow necromancy, they are left imbued with a powerful and evil energy.\n  | pic                      = Handwraps Generic.png\n  | picdesc                  = Grave Wrappings.png\n  | tips                     = This item, like the others from this chain, can be acquired as an end reward for the chain as {{Bind|BtC|BoA}}.\n\nIf you have a {{Manslayer|nocat=1}} effect applied from another item that effect will override the level drain for most MOBs. However, if the target is immune to the Manslayer effect, then the level drain will trigger.\n}}",
